<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>03 · 关键实现 ② 执行边界</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 31, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>检查点负责「接着跑」，权限两层负责「改不了」</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>这两件事都落在执行层：不是提示词嘱咐，而是流程上过不去</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 190, width: 560, height: 270, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>可恢复：三个必要件</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 78, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 12, paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>检查点：每步结束落一次状态</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 5 }}>存在 SQLite，与消息一起持久化，进程重启也不丢</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 78, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 12, paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>中断：写操作前主动暂停</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 5 }}>图停在中断点，等待用户确认，而非直接执行</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 78, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 12, paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>恢复：从检查点继续</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 5 }}>确认后按原路径续跑，无需重放整段对话</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 700, top: 190, width: 504, height: 276, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>权限两层：看得见 ≠ 跑得动</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 34, alignItems: 'center', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, paddingLeft: 10, marginTop: 10 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 120 }}>子角色</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 190 }}>模型可见工具</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 160 }}>执行层处置</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 52, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingLeft: 10 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1A2230', width: 120 }}>讲解 / 检索</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 190 }}>全部工具</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1E4FA8', width: 160 }}>放行（写需确认）</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 52, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingLeft: 10 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1A2230', width: 120 }}>练习</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 190 }}>只读工具</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#D9534F', width: 160 }}>写操作直接拒绝</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 52, alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 10 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1A2230', width: 120 }}>进度</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 190 }}>无工具</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#D9534F', width: 160 }}>一律拦截</Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>
      为什么必须两层：只遮列表，模型仍会说出被禁工具名而失败；只拦执行，模型会反复重试浪费轮数。
    </Text>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 470, width: 1128, height: 82, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20 }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#3D7BD9', width: 78 }}>写操作</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1A2230', width: 150 }}>模型发起落库</Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', width: 30 }}>→</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#3D7BD9', width: 78 }}>第 2 步</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1A2230', width: 190 }}>图在中断点暂停</Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', width: 30 }}>→</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#3D7BD9', width: 78 }}>第 3 步</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1A2230', width: 190 }}>用户点确认</Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', width: 30 }}>→</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#3D7BD9', width: 78 }}>第 4 步</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1A2230', width: 170 }}>从检查点恢复并落库</Text>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 568, width: 1128, height: 46, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      证据：状态图 + 检查点 + 中断恢复均有回归测试；练习角色调用写工具时，执行层返回拒绝，数据未被修改
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>07 / 11</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
